      "content": "thanks. i really feel like the \"narrative\" part is key because the council didn't just take the land, they tried to erase our entire existence from the record. i have these scans of the 1924 ledger and some letters from my great-grandfather that clearly mention the \"shadowed decrees\" used against us. i want to write something that sounds official and dignified, not like a crazy conspiracy theory, but something that makes people realize something was stolen. can you help me draft a manifesto that focuses on the injustice of the seizure and our right to return to our status?",
